,76,68],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007302","armor":"WP1010602","helmet":"WP1013002"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10104","city":"CS1013","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[47,21,81,83,76,68],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007302","armor":"WP1010602","helmet":"WP1013002"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[{"kind":"plot","id":"1004308","name":{"zh":"荀翎完婚","en":"Xun Ling's Wedding"},"year":"203","month":"7","desc":{"zh":"","en":""}}],"biography":{"zh":"曹魏谋士荀彧之女，出身于书香世家荀氏一族。在荀彧的教诲下，为人刚正好学，从未停止过古籍的阅读，并在成年后嫁给了同为颍川出身的名门陈群。在陈群开始着手制定律法后，荀翎常常为其弥补疏忽之处。后又为陈群推荐了自己的弟弟荀顗，荀顗在魏任官后又多有功绩，为魏晋的制度拟定做出了许多贡献。","tc":"曹魏謀士荀彧之女，出身于書香世家荀氏一族。在荀彧的教誨下，為人剛正好學，從未停止過古籍的閱讀，并在成年后嫁給了同為潁川出身的名門陳群。在陳群開始著手制定律法后，荀翎常常為其彌補疏忽之處。后又為陳群推薦了自己的弟弟荀顗，荀顗在魏任官后又多有功績，為魏晉的制度擬定做出了許多貢獻。","en":"The daughter of Xun Yu, the great strategist of Cao Wei, born into the illustrious scholarly Xun clan. Under Xun Yu's guidance, she grew into a person of upright character and scholarly devotion, never ceasing her study of classical texts. Upon reaching adulthood, she married Chen Qun, who was also from a distinguished family of Yingchuan. As Chen Qun undertook the drafting of legal codes, Xun Ling often helped him identify and correct oversights. She also recommended her younger brother Xun Yi to Chen Qun. After Xun Yi entered Wei service, he earned many merits and made significant contributions to the institutional framework of the Wei-Jin era.","jp":"曹魏の軍師・荀彧の娘であり、名門の家柄である荀氏一族に生まれた。父・荀彧の教えを受け、剛直で学を好み、古籍の読書を怠ることはなかった。成人後は同じく潁川出身の名門・陳群に嫁いだ。陳群が律法の制定に着手すると、荀翎はしばしばその不備を補った。のちに弟の荀顗を陳群に推挙し、魏に出仕した荀顗は多くの功績を挙げ、魏晋の制度制定に多大な貢献を果たした。","kr":"조위의 모사 순욱의 딸로, 유서 깊은 학자 가문인 순씨 일족 출신이다. 순욱의 가르침을 받아 성품이 강직하고 배움을 좋아하여 고서 읽기를 게을리하지 않았으며, 장성한 뒤 같은 영천 출신의 명문가 진군에게 출가하였다. 진군이 율법 제정에 착수하자 미처 살피지 못한 빈틈을 자주 보완해 주었다. 이후 진군에게 남동생 순의를 천거하였는데, 순의는 위나라에 출사하여 많은 공적을 세우고 위·진의 제도 마련에 크게 기여하였다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ11038","remark":"","surname":"荀","surnameTc":"荀","surnameEn":"Xun","surnameJp":"荀","surnameKr":"순","surnameOther":"","name":"翎","nameTc":"翎","nameEn":"Ling","nameJp":"翎","nameKr":"령","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"荀翎","power":"WJ10001","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"222","city":"CS1026","gender":"1","rule":"47","force":"21","wise":"81","politics":"83","charm":"76","will":"68","ruleTalent":"6","forceTalent":"3","wiseTalent":"10","politicsTalent":"10","charmTalent":"10","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"7/7/7/7/7/93/57/7","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"1005105;16","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"1002405","warSoulPoint":"2200","battleSoulPoint":"400","debateSoulPoint":"6600","strategy":"","strategy2":"1001505","professions":"0/0/0/1/1/0/0/3/2/3/1/1/0/2/0/1/1/3/5/3/0/0/2/3","attribute2":"53/21/86/89/76/68","morality":"6","compatible":"32","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"181","show":"195","death":"259","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"1","weapon":"WP1007302","armor":"WP1010602","helmet":"WP1013002","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"2/1;8/1;15/1;21/1;27/1;33/1;41/1;60/1;36/0;43/0","father":"WJ10082/0","mother":"","children":"WJ10678/100","family":"WJ10683/100;WJ1043115/100;WJ10779/100","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYear":"0","description":"曹魏谋士荀彧之女，出身于书香世家荀氏一族。在荀彧的教诲下，为人刚正好学，从未停止过古籍的阅读，并在成年后嫁给了同为颍川出身的